  "tone": {
    "$comment": "Color tones (Settings → Appearance): the accent the app is painted in, after exodus's colour tone. Values are nipponcolors.com's traditional colours. scripts/gen-tokens.mjs derives per scheme a fill (shapes, ≥3:1 on the sidebar), an ink (text, ≥4.6:1) and on-fill text, and refuses tones that can't meet those; it emits ColorTone (Swift) and [data-tone] palettes (editor CSS).",
